{"slug":"upgrade-these-simple-ways-to-style-your-goal-set","title":"Upgrade these simple ways to style your goal setting that help you get the look without the stress with beginner-friendly tips","fps":25,"width":720,"height":1280,"duration_s":19.08,"frames":477,"arc":{"segments":8,"luma":[0.015,0.134,0.135,0.239,0.184,0.197,0.058,0.024],"saturation":[0.266,0.383,0.369,0.374,0.258,0.278,0.249,0.214],"warmth_r_over_b":[1.359,1.7,1.368,1.461,0.912,0.874,2.075,3.679],"contrast":[0.053,0.088,0.133,0.163,0.101,0.111,0.056,0.099],"motion_energy":[0.002,0.014,0.02,0.01,0.006,0.003,0.006,0.005],"zoom_energy":[1.621,1.312,0.225,0.041,0.013,0.01,1.821,0.048]},"moves":{"slow pull-out + tilt/pedestal down (content moves down)":1,"pan right (content moves right)":1,"pull-out + pan left (content moves left)":1,"pan left (content moves left)":1,"slow pull-out":1,"static":1,"slow push-in":3,"slow push-in + tilt/pedestal down (content moves down)":1,"pull-out":1},"review":{"kind":"product-ad","subject":"Black and gold oud perfume bottle with agarwood chips and smoke","summary":"A dark, moody fragrance spot fades the bottle up out of black, cuts to agarwood chips and a resin bowl, then shows a smoke-filled close-up and a long hero shot on a black plinth before fading to a gold particle logo reveal. About 19 seconds, 11 shots, slow camera moves and hard cuts between ingredient and bottle.","beats":[{"t":"0.0-2.9","beat":"hook","note":"Bottle faintly emerges from black with a slow pull-out and tilt down."},{"t":"2.9-4.5","beat":"world","note":"Top-down agarwood chips on a tray, pan right."},{"t":"4.5-6.6","beat":"reveal","note":"Bottle lit gold from the dark, label comes up, slow pans."},{"t":"6.6-8.2","beat":"world","note":"Resin bowl with chips and incense smoke, slow pull-out."},{"t":"8.2-10.2","beat":"macro","note":"Close crop on bottle label and cap through smoke."},{"t":"10.2-16.4","beat":"hero","note":"Wide bottle on black plinth in smoke, long slow push-in then fade down."},{"t":"16.4-19.1","beat":"end-card","note":"Gold sparks and streaks resolve into a calligraphic brand logo on black."}],"shot_labels":[{"shot":1,"scale":"medium","beat":"hook","note":"Bottle emerging from black, pull-out"},{"shot":2,"scale":"close","beat":"world","note":"Agarwood chips, pan right"},{"shot":3,"scale":"close","beat":"reveal","note":"Dark bottle, pull-out and pan left"},{"shot":4,"scale":"close","beat":"reveal","note":"Gold label lit, pan left"},{"shot":5,"scale":"close","beat":"world","note":"Resin bowl and chips, slow pull-out"},{"shot":6,"scale":"close","beat":"macro","note":"Label and cap in smoke, static"},{"shot":7,"scale":"medium","beat":"hero","note":"Wide hero on plinth, 4.7s slow push-in"},{"shot":8,"scale":"medium","beat":"transition","note":"Hero fading to black"},{"shot":9,"scale":"graphic","beat":"end-card","note":"Gold sparks streak across black"},{"shot":10,"scale":"graphic","beat":"end-card","note":"Logo forming from particles"},{"shot":11,"scale":"graphic","beat":"end-card","note":"Logo settled with sparkles"}],"learn":["Start from near black (luma about 0.02) and let the product emerge for about 3s; low-key lighting makes the gold detail feel precious.","Cut away to raw ingredients (chips, resin bowl) for 1.5-2s each between bottle shots to give the scent a story.","Give the final hero one long calm shot of about 4.7s with a barely perceptible push-in; smoke provides motion without camera work.","Fade to black before a 2.5s particle logo reveal so the brand card feels like a separate sting."]},"shots":[{"idx":1,"start_s":0,"end_s":2.92,"dur_s":2.92,"enters_via":"start","move":"slow pull-out + tilt/pedestal down (content moves down)","ease":"easeIn (accelerating)","zoom_pct":-4.22,"pan_pct":10.16,"tilt_pct":17.18,"jitter":0,"luma":0.018,"contrast":0.063,"saturation":0.244,"warmth":1.35,"key_style":"low-key","temperature":"warm","hue":"red","dof_ratio":7.9},{"idx":2,"start_s":2.92,"end_s":4.48,"dur_s":1.56,"enters_via":"hard","move":"pan r